@EasyCreditApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@ApiKey = easycredit_dummy_kxxObJ12OBkUBooOzMEPLZyUfsQn2U2v

### [DAY 4] Login Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "email": "admin@mail.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Simpan token dari response login
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### [DAY 5] Lab: Ping Oracle DB
GET {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/_dbping
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### [DAY 5] Lab: Transaction Demo
POST {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/_tx-demo?fail=false
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### [DAY 5] Get Customers (Dapper Raw SQL Pagination)
GET {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### [DAY 5] Create Customer (Raw SQL)
POST {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "nik": "3201012345678901",
  "phone": "08123456789",
  "email": "budi.santoso@example.com",
  "address": "Jl. Merdeka No. 10 Jakarta"
}

### =====================================================================
### [DAY 6] STORED PROCEDURE ENDPOINTS (Dapper.Oracle & SYS_REFCURSOR)
### =====================================================================

### [DAY 6] Get All Customers via Stored Procedure
GET {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/sp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### [DAY 6] Get Customer by ID via Stored Procedure
GET {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/sp/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### [DAY 6] Create Customer via Stored Procedure
POST {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/sp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Siti Rahma",
  "nik": "3201019988770001",
  "phone": "08198765432",
  "email": "siti.rahma@example.com",
  "address": "Jl. Sudirman No. 45 Bandung"
}

### [DAY 6] Get All Credit Applications via Stored Procedure
GET {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/credit-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### [DAY 6] Approve Credit Application via Stored Procedure
POST {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/api/credit-applications/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approver": "Credit Analyst Supervisor"
}

### [DAY 6] Lab: Reset Application to SUBMITTED (Dev only)
POST {{EasyCreditApi_HostAddress}}/_reset-app/1
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
